---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Chinese-Zodiac-Calculator.com - Chinese Zodiac Guide"
  description="Learn about Chinese-Zodiac-Calculator.com, the free Chinese zodiac calculator. Discover your animal sign, element, personality, and compatibility through our easy tools."
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Home", href: "/" }, { label: "About", href: "/about" }]}
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-[800px] px-4 py-12 lg:px-6 lg:py-16">
    <h1 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100 sm:text-4xl">About <span class="text-[#DC2626]">Chinese-Zodiac-Calculator.com</span></h1>

    <div class="prose prose-stone max-w-none dark:prose-invert">
      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">Chinese-Zodiac-Calculator.com is a free online tool that helps you discover your Chinese zodiac animal sign, element, personality traits, compatibility, and more — all based on your birth date.</p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Our Mission</h2>
      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">We believe that ancient Chinese zodiac wisdom should be accessible to everyone. Our mission is to provide accurate, easy-to-understand readings that help you gain insight into your personality, relationships, and life path — at no cost.</p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">How It Works</h2>
      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">Our calculator uses traditional Chinese lunar calendar algorithms to determine your zodiac animal and element. Unlike many other calculators, we account for the lunar new year transition date, ensuring your sign is calculated correctly even if you were born in January or February.</p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">What We Offer</h2>
      <ul class="mt-2 space-y-2 text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span class="text-[#DC2626]">&#10003;</span> <span><strong class="text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Zodiac Calculator</strong> — instantly find your animal sign and element.</span></li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span class="text-[#DC2626]">&#10003;</span> <span><strong class="text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Compatibility Checker</strong> — see how your sign matches with others.</span></li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span class="text-[#DC2626]">&#10003;</span> <span><strong class="text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Element Guide</strong> — learn about the five elements and their influence.</span></li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span class="text-[#DC2626]">&#10003;</span> <span><strong class="text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Yearly Horoscopes</strong> — read annual predictions for all 12 signs.</span></li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm"><span class="text-[#DC2626]">&#10003;</span> <span><strong class="text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Feng Shui Tips</strong> — harmonize your home based on your element.</span></li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Our Team</h2>
      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">Chinese-Zodiac-Calculator.com is built by a small team of developers, astrological researchers, and feng shui enthusiasts who share a passion for Chinese metaphysics. We combine traditional knowledge with modern technology to deliver the best zodiac experience on the web.</p>

      <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">Accuracy &amp; Disclaimer</h2>
      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">While we strive for maximum accuracy in our calculations, Chinese zodiac readings are for entertainment, educational, and informational purposes only. Decisions about your life, career, relationships, and health should always be made with careful personal consideration.</p>
    </div>
